                         2043 | ;
                         2044 | ;   RENAME FILE
                         2045 | ;
                         2046 | ;   ON ENTRY THE CONTENTS OF (DE) POINTS TO A 32
                         2047 | ;   BYTE BLOCK WHERE THE FIRST 16 BYTES ARE THE
                         2048 | ;   OLD FILENAME.TYP AND THE SECOND 16 ARE THE
                         2049 | ;   NEW FILENAME.EXT. THIS PIECE OF CODE MAKES A
                         2050 | ;   12 BYTE SEARCH TO MATCH THE OLD FILENAME.TYP
                         2051 | ;   WITH ENTRIES IN THE DIRECTORY. WHEN A MATCH
                         2052 | ;   IS MADE THE NEW FILENAME.TYP IS INSERTED INTO
                         2053 | ;   THE DIRECTORY SECTOR AND THE SECTOR WRITTTEN
